<title>SINGAPORE: Powermatic's Hewlett-Packard deal ends.</title>
<headline>Powermatic's Hewlett-Packard deal ends.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Powermatic Data Systems Ltd said on Monday it had ceased to be a reseller of Hewlett-Packard (HP) products as of April 30, 1997.</p>
<p>Sales of HP products by Powermatic amounted to Singapore $18.23 million for the financial year ended 28 February 1997.</p>
<p>Powermatic said sales of HP products made up 24.2 percent of its total distribution sales and 17.7 percent of group sales, contributing about Singapore $570,000 of gross profit.</p>
<p>Powermatic said it had firm plans to expand sales of existing products to new markets and the development of new products.  </p>
<p>Powermatic suffered an interim loss of S$850,000 for the six months ended August 31, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
